# Finished tasks

When the user says "good to go", the task just finished is accepted. Record it in `documentation/done.md`. Create the file if it is missing.

Put the newest entry first, under `# Done`. Each entry has the task title and what was done.

```markdown
# Done

## Short task title

What changed, and why, in a few sentences.
```

Record only the work accepted by that phrase. Leave `documentation/done.md` unchanged until the user says "good to go".
